    <section class="home-section home-usecases-section" id="who-its-for">

        <div class="home-section-heading">
            <span class="home-eyebrow">MADE FOR EVERYDAY PLANNING</span>

            <h2>One system for different kinds of work.</h2>

            <p>
                Whether you are managing personal responsibilities
                or keeping track of ongoing work, the same task
                planning principles can help you stay organised.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="home-usecases-grid">

            <article class="home-usecase-card">
                <span class="usecase-number">01</span>
                <h3>Personal responsibilities</h3>
                <p>
                    Keep important activities, errands and things you
                    need to remember together in one workspace.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="home-usecase-card">
                <span class="usecase-number">02</span>
                <h3>Study and learning</h3>
                <p>
                    Plan study sessions, schedule work and keep an eye
                    on deadlines for your learning activities.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="home-usecase-card">
                <span class="usecase-number">03</span>
                <h3>Projects and goals</h3>
                <p>
                    Break your workload into individual tasks, set
                    timelines and review your progress as you go.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="home-usecase-card">
                <span class="usecase-number">04</span>
                <h3>Time-sensitive work</h3>
                <p>
                    Give tasks clear start and due times, then use
                    suitable reminder intervals when reminders are
                    enabled.
                </p>
            </article>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =====================================================
         WORKFLOW SUMMARY
         ===================================================== -->

    <section class="home-workflow-section">

        <div class="home-workflow-content">

            <span class="home-eyebrow">YOUR WORKFLOW</span>

            <h2>From an idea to a completed task.</h2>

            <p>
                Keep the process simple. Capture what needs to be done,
                decide when it should happen, manage the task as plans
                change, and review your progress.
            </p>

            <div class="home-workflow-steps">

                <div class="home-workflow-step">
                    <span>1</span>
                    <strong>Create</strong>
                </div>

                <div class="workflow-connector"></div>

                <div class="home-workflow-step">
                    <span>2</span>
                    <strong>Schedule</strong>
                </div>

                <div class="workflow-connector"></div>

                <div class="home-workflow-step">
                    <span>3</span>
                    <strong>Manage</strong>
                </div>

                <div class="workflow-connector"></div>

                <div class="home-workflow-step">
                    <span>4</span>
                    <strong>Review</strong>
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =====================================================
         FAQ
         ===================================================== -->

    <section class="home-section home-faq-section" id="faq">

        <div class="home-section-heading">
            <span class="home-eyebrow">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</span>

            <h2>Get to know KeepTrack.</h2>

            <p>
                A few quick answers about how the task management
                workflow operates.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="home-faq-list">

            <details class="home-faq-item">
                <summary>What can I use KeepTrack for?</summary>
                <p>
                    You can use KeepTrack to organise tasks, plan start
                    and due dates, configure available reminders, review
                    your tasks on the dashboard and calendar, and examine
                    task-related statistics.
                </p>
            </details>

            <details class="home-faq-item">
                <summary>Do all tasks need a scheduled start time?</summary>
                <p>
                    No. You can choose to start a task immediately or
                    schedule it to begin at a future date and time.
                </p>
            </details>

            <details class="home-faq-item">
                <summary>Can I enable reminders without a due date?</summary>
                <p>
                    No. A valid due date and time after the task start
                    are required before reminders can be enabled.
                </p>
            </details>

            <details class="home-faq-item">
                <summary>Why do reminder units change with task duration?</summary>
                <p>
                    KeepTrack limits the available reminder units
                    according to the task's start and due date/time.
                    Shorter tasks use hour intervals, while longer
                    tasks may support day, week, month or year intervals
                    as the duration increases.
                </p>
            </details>

            <details class="home-faq-item">
                <summary>Can I change a task after creating it?</summary>
                <p>
                    Yes. Use Edit Task to update the task's details
                    and scheduling information when your plans change.
                </p>
            </details>

            <details class="home-faq-item">
                <summary>Does the dashboard preview show my actual tasks?</summary>
                <p>
                    No. The examples on this home page are illustrative.
                    Your actual task information is available in your
                    KeepTrack workspace after you sign in.
                </p>
            </details>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- =====================================================
         FINAL CTA
         ===================================================== -->

    <section class="home-final-section">

        <div class="home-final-decoration home-final-decoration-one"></div>
        <div class="home-final-decoration home-final-decoration-two"></div>

        <div class="home-final-content">

            <span class="home-eyebrow">YOUR NEXT STEP STARTS HERE</span>

